{"id": "99210015", "name": "אי-שוויון מרקוב ואי-שוויון צ'בישב – חסמים לגובה של סטודנט", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>הגובה הממוצע (בס\"מ) של סטודנט באוניברסיטה הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span>, וסטיית התקן היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span>. יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> הגובה של סטודנט שנבחר באקראי (כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]={{CT:0}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}[X]={{CT:2}}\\)</span>; הגובה חיובי).</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. מהו החסם העליון על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(X\\ge {{CT:3}})\\)</span> שנותן אי-שוויון מרקוב?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. מהו החסם העליון על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(|X-{{CT:0}}|\\ge {{CT:4}})\\)</span> שנותן אי-שוויון צ'בישב?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — אי-שוויון מרקוב</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> אי-שלילי, ולכן לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a>0\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(X\\ge a)\\le \\frac{\\mathbb{E}[X]}{a}\\)</span>. עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a={{CT:3}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}(X\\ge {{CT:3}})\\le\\frac{ {{CT:0}} }{ {{CT:3}} }={{CT:5}} \\]</p>החסם חלש מאוד: מרקוב משתמש רק בתוחלת.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — אי-שוויון צ'בישב</b><br>לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d>0\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(|X-\\mathbb{E}[X]|\\ge d)\\le\\frac{\\mathsf{Var}[X]}{d^2}\\)</span>. עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d={{CT:4}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}(|X-{{CT:0}}|\\ge {{CT:4}})\\le\\frac{ {{CT:2}} }{ {{CT:6}} }={{CT:7}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "t1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "t2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "si/dd", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<p>באי-שוויון צ'בישב מופיעה השונות, \\(\\sigma^2\\), ובמכנה \\(d^2\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["aa", "dd", "mu", "si", "t1", "t2"], "nvariants": 50}